sequenceDiagram
    participant Pos as PosTerminal
    participant Sales as OfflineSalesStore
    participant Fiscal as OfflineFiscalNfceService
    participant Sqlite as OfflineDbContext
    participant Worker as SyncBackgroundWorker
    participant Api as PushSyncBatch
    participant Sefaz as INfceGateway

    Pos->>Sales: CreateAndPayOrder
    Sales->>Sqlite: Order Paid plus stock
    alt issuer and A1 cached
        Sales->>Fiscal: TryEnqueueContingencyNfce
        Fiscal->>Sqlite: FiscalDocument ContingencyIssued
        Fiscal->>Sqlite: Outbox TransmitNfce after Pay
    end
    Sales->>Sqlite: Outbox CreateOrder then PayOrder
    Sales->>Worker: RequestSyncIfOnline
    Worker->>Api: FIFO Create Pay TransmitNfce
    Api->>Sefaz: XML contingencia tpEmis 9
    Sefaz-->>Api: Authorized or Rejected
